        "original_id": "9f5b5c7a-9d84-55f4-9ceb-23b403cc62df",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Stoke City F.C., Bet365 Group Ltd\n- Events: 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, Stoke City F.C. 150th anniversary\n- Products: away kit, special crest\n- Topics: shirt sponsorship, club history, gambling company\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, the club marked its 150th year in existence with a special crest.\n- In the 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, Stoke City F.C.'s away kit used the navy and cardinal colors worn by Stoke Ramblers in 1863.\n- In the 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, Bet365 became Stoke City F.C.'s new shirt sponsor, replacing Britannia.\n- Bet365 Group Ltd, styled as bet365, is a gambling company based in the United Kingdom.",
